<%- include('components/layout') -%>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <%- include('components/effects/loader') -%>
    <header class="image-wrapper fade-in-d">
      <div class="branding-container">
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/RksHmpP7/logo.webp" class="logoimg">
        <h1 class="MainHeader">Hexion</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="addiv adspecial">
        <p>Ad space here</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/dashboard">
        <button type="submit" class="starting-btn">Start Coding!</button>
      </a>
      <p class="header-message">YOU CODE IT, WE <span class="header-special">FIX</span> IT.</p>
      <img src="https://i.ibb.co/tTmtdgdg/background.webp" class="mainimg">
    </header>
      <main>
        <div class="addiv">
          <p>Ad space here</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="fade-in-d feature">
            <i class='bx bx-shutter-alt'></i>
            <h2>Many Tools</h2>
            <p>We have many tools right now available at just a few clicks from simple encoders to highly powerful code debuggers, here we have a solutions for the hardest coding problems, start using them right now.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fade-in-d feature">
            <i class='bx bx-pie-chart-alt'></i>
            <h2>Fast & Secure</h2>
            <p>Our website is made fast so it could on the worst hardware, as you can start developing on lowend hardwares, you can also run our website on any kind of hardware. Our website is made secure, so while you fix you're developing issues, you won't have to worry about the security of you're device.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fade-in-d feature">
            <i class='bx bx-flask-round'></i>
            <h2>Free of Cost</h2>
            <p>We take no amount of money from you to use all of our tools, they are totally free of cost, we have no hidden fees,no extra charges.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fade-in-d feature">
            <i class="bx bx-extension"></i>
            <h2>Easy to Use</h2>
            <p>Our website is made easy to use so anyone with a brain can easily access and use all of our tools without any doubts, no rocket science required just a few clicks and you've your results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <section id="faq">
          <div class="faq-heading fade-in-d">
            <h3 class="fade-in-d">FAQS</h3>
            <p class="fade-in-d">FAQS are here to clear you're doubts about our website/service, so that you can use all of our features without any worrys. If you're doubts are not cleared here you can contact us<br /> <span class="contact">Contact - <strong class="faq-email">eluminushosting@gmail.com</strong> or <a href="https://discord.gg/zkGcUK9nkn" class="faq-discord">Discord</a></span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-content fade-in-d">
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>What features does you're website have ?</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>Our website has alot of features to help you make you're programming easier. We have many tools yo help you with these daily programming tasks that take you're precious time. So go see them for yourself.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>Is you're service completely free ?</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>Yes our service is completely free we will never force you to pay money to use our tools, all our tools and <strong>Everything</strong> on this website is free.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>How to upload my file to your website ?</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>Uploading a code file is easy just click on the upload file button and it should redirect you to you're file manager then go to you're desired file click on it, this should start uploading your file then you can continue using our website.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>How do you earn money with this being free ?</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>Well in our case we want every developer to have enough of tools for free so they could begin in their journey. It is hard to make money while it is free, but we get enough from the ads across the website they arent too distracting and earn us enough to keep the site running.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>How many encoding/encrypting formats are supported</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>We support alot of fornats from the most pupolar to leaat used once, we have them all in stock. we've 10 supported for encoding as well as encrypting And also their decoding & decrypting versions.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box-container fade-in-d">
              <div class="faq-box">
                <div class="faq-box-question">
                  <h4>How to use the Error Debugging feature ?</h4>
                  <span class="faq-box-icon"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-box-answer">
                  <div>
                    <p>To use Error Debugging in you're code file you need to upload the code file then click find error button then wait for 5-10s it should display all the lines where an error occurs then you can fix all the errors easily.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <%- include('components/footer') -%>
      </main>
    </div>
    <!--function Import-->
    <script src="/js/api/faq.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/effects/incoming.js" defer></script>
    
    <!--disabling header css-->
    <script>document.getElementById("header").disabled = true</script>
</body>

</html>